<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Homelab Central – Touchid</title><link>https://homelabcentral.net/tags/touchid/</link><description>Recent content in Touchid on Homelab Central</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://homelabcentral.net/tags/touchid/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Touch ID for sudo</title><link>https://homelabcentral.net/blog/touch-id-for-sudo/</link><pubDate>Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://homelabcentral.net/blog/touch-id-for-sudo/</guid><description>
&lt;div class="hextra-lead"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Two lines to use touchid to authenticate sudo and with tmux.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Touch ID is the best thing on a Mac. It logs you in, pays for things, signs you
into Apple&amp;rsquo;s own sites. So the obvious question: can it authenticate &lt;code&gt;sudo&lt;/code&gt;
too? It can, and it takes two minutes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="works-on"&gt;Works on&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="works-on"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#works-on" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class="hextra-badge hextra-badge--lg "&gt;
&lt;span class="hextra-badge__pill hx:border hx:border-green-400 hx:bg-green-100 hx:text-green-950 hx:dark:border-green-800 hx:dark:bg-green-950 hx:dark:text-green-100"&gt;&lt;span class="hextra-badge__icon"&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16"&gt;&lt;defs&gt;&lt;path id="SVG67go7b2R" d="M11.182.008C11.148-.03 9.923.023 8.857 1.18c-1.066 1.156-.902 2.482-.878 2.516s1.52.087 2.475-1.258s.762-2.391.728-2.43m3.314 11.733c-.048-.096-2.325-1.234-2.113-3.422s1.675-2.789 1.698-2.854s-.597-.79-1.254-1.157a3.7 3.7 0 0 0-1.563-.434c-.108-.003-.483-.095-1.254.116c-.508.139-1.653.589-1.968.607c-.316.018-1.256-.522-2.267-.665c-.647-.125-1.333.131-1.824.328c-.49.196-1.422.754-2.074 2.237c-.652 1.482-.311 3.83-.067 4.56s.625 1.924 1.273 2.796c.576.984 1.34 1.667 1.659 1.899s1.219.386 1.843.067c.502-.308 1.408-.485 1.766-.472c.357.013 1.061.154 1.782.539c.571.197 1.111.115 1.652-.105c.541-.221 1.324-1.059 2.238-2.758q.52-1.185.473-1.282"/&gt;&lt;/defs&gt;&lt;g fill="currentColor"&gt;&lt;use href="#SVG67go7b2R"/&gt;&lt;use href="#SVG67go7b2R"/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Sonoma 14&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hextra-badge hextra-badge--lg "&gt;
&lt;span class="hextra-badge__pill hx:border hx:border-blue-400 hx:bg-blue-100 hx:text-blue-950 hx:dark:border-blue-800 hx:dark:bg-blue-950 hx:dark:text-blue-100"&gt;&lt;span class="hextra-badge__icon"&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16"&gt;&lt;defs&gt;&lt;path id="SVG67go7b2R" d="M11.182.008C11.148-.03 9.923.023 8.857 1.18c-1.066 1.156-.902 2.482-.878 2.516s1.52.087 2.475-1.258s.762-2.391.728-2.43m3.314 11.733c-.048-.096-2.325-1.234-2.113-3.422s1.675-2.789 1.698-2.854s-.597-.79-1.254-1.157a3.7 3.7 0 0 0-1.563-.434c-.108-.003-.483-.095-1.254.116c-.508.139-1.653.589-1.968.607c-.316.018-1.256-.522-2.267-.665c-.647-.125-1.333.131-1.824.328c-.49.196-1.422.754-2.074 2.237c-.652 1.482-.311 3.83-.067 4.56s.625 1.924 1.273 2.796c.576.984 1.34 1.667 1.659 1.899s1.219.386 1.843.067c.502-.308 1.408-.485 1.766-.472c.357.013 1.061.154 1.782.539c.571.197 1.111.115 1.652-.105c.541-.221 1.324-1.059 2.238-2.758q.52-1.185.473-1.282"/&gt;&lt;/defs&gt;&lt;g fill="currentColor"&gt;&lt;use href="#SVG67go7b2R"/&gt;&lt;use href="#SVG67go7b2R"/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Sequoia 15&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hextra-badge hextra-badge--lg "&gt;
&lt;span class="hextra-badge__pill hx:border hx:border-indigo-400 hx:bg-indigo-100 hx:text-indigo-950 hx:dark:border-indigo-800 hx:dark:bg-indigo-950 hx:dark:text-indigo-100"&gt;&lt;span class="hextra-badge__icon"&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16"&gt;&lt;defs&gt;&lt;path id="SVG67go7b2R" d="M11.182.008C11.148-.03 9.923.023 8.857 1.18c-1.066 1.156-.902 2.482-.878 2.516s1.52.087 2.475-1.258s.762-2.391.728-2.43m3.314 11.733c-.048-.096-2.325-1.234-2.113-3.422s1.675-2.789 1.698-2.854s-.597-.79-1.254-1.157a3.7 3.7 0 0 0-1.563-.434c-.108-.003-.483-.095-1.254.116c-.508.139-1.653.589-1.968.607c-.316.018-1.256-.522-2.267-.665c-.647-.125-1.333.131-1.824.328c-.49.196-1.422.754-2.074 2.237c-.652 1.482-.311 3.83-.067 4.56s.625 1.924 1.273 2.796c.576.984 1.34 1.667 1.659 1.899s1.219.386 1.843.067c.502-.308 1.408-.485 1.766-.472c.357.013 1.061.154 1.782.539c.571.197 1.111.115 1.652-.105c.541-.221 1.324-1.059 2.238-2.758q.52-1.185.473-1.282"/&gt;&lt;/defs&gt;&lt;g fill="currentColor"&gt;&lt;use href="#SVG67go7b2R"/&gt;&lt;use href="#SVG67go7b2R"/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Tahoe 26&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="hextra-badge hextra-badge--lg "&gt;
&lt;span class="hextra-badge__pill hx:border hx:border-purple-400 hx:bg-purple-100 hx:text-purple-950 hx:dark:border-purple-800 hx:dark:bg-purple-950 hx:dark:text-purple-100"&gt;&lt;span class="hextra-badge__icon"&gt;&lt;svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16"&gt;&lt;defs&gt;&lt;path id="SVG67go7b2R" d="M11.182.008C11.148-.03 9.923.023 8.857 1.18c-1.066 1.156-.902 2.482-.878 2.516s1.52.087 2.475-1.258s.762-2.391.728-2.43m3.314 11.733c-.048-.096-2.325-1.234-2.113-3.422s1.675-2.789 1.698-2.854s-.597-.79-1.254-1.157a3.7 3.7 0 0 0-1.563-.434c-.108-.003-.483-.095-1.254.116c-.508.139-1.653.589-1.968.607c-.316.018-1.256-.522-2.267-.665c-.647-.125-1.333.131-1.824.328c-.49.196-1.422.754-2.074 2.237c-.652 1.482-.311 3.83-.067 4.56s.625 1.924 1.273 2.796c.576.984 1.34 1.667 1.659 1.899s1.219.386 1.843.067c.502-.308 1.408-.485 1.766-.472c.357.013 1.061.154 1.782.539c.571.197 1.111.115 1.652-.105c.541-.221 1.324-1.059 2.238-2.758q.52-1.185.473-1.282"/&gt;&lt;/defs&gt;&lt;g fill="currentColor"&gt;&lt;use href="#SVG67go7b2R"/&gt;&lt;use href="#SVG67go7b2R"/&gt;&lt;/g&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Golden Gate 27&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;/etc/pam.d/sudo_local&lt;/code&gt; arrived in Sonoma. On Ventura 13 and earlier neither it
nor its template exists: the same &lt;code&gt;auth sufficient pam_tid.so&lt;/code&gt; line goes into
&lt;code&gt;/etc/pam.d/sudo&lt;/code&gt; itself, and every major OS update wipes it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="touch-id-for-sudo"&gt;Touch ID for sudo&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="touch-id-for-sudo"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#touch-id-for-sudo" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-steps hx:ml-4 hx:mb-12 hx:ltr:border-l hx:rtl:border-r hx:border-neutral-200 hx:ltr:pl-6 hx:rtl:pr-6 hx:dark:border-neutral-800 [counter-reset:step]"&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="open-a-root-shell-first"&gt;Open a root shell first&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="open-a-root-shell-first"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#open-a-root-shell-first" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;In a second window, and leave it open until everything below works:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo -s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-neutral-200 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-neutral-600 hx:hover:text-neutral-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-neutral-800 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-neutral-400 hx:dark:hover:text-neutral-50" title="Copy code" aria-label="Copy code" data-copied-label="Copied!"&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:overflow-x-auto hx:mt-6 hx:flex hx:rounded-lg hx:border hx:py-2 hx:ltr:pr-4 hx:rtl:pl-4 hx:contrast-more:border-current hx:contrast-more:dark:border-current hx:border-amber-400 hx:bg-amber-50 hx:text-amber-700 hx:dark:border-amber-500/70 hx:dark:bg-amber-950/60 hx:dark:text-amber-400"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:ltr:pl-3 hx:ltr:pr-2 hx:rtl:pr-3 hx:rtl:pl-2"&gt;&lt;svg height=1.2em class="hx:inline-block hx:align-middle" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="M6.457 1.047c.659-1.234 2.427-1.234 3.086 0l6.082 11.378A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 14.082 15H1.918a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.543-2.575Zm1.763.707a.25.25 0 0 0-.44 0L1.698 13.132a.25.25 0 0 0 .22.368h12.164a.25.25 0 0 0 .22-.368Zm.53 3.996v2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.5 0v-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 1.5 0ZM9 11a1 1 0 1 1-2 0 1 1 0 0 1 2 0Z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:w-full hx:min-w-0 hx:leading-7"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:mt-6 hx:leading-7 hx:first:mt-0"&gt;A broken file in &lt;code&gt;/etc/pam.d&lt;/code&gt; makes every &lt;code&gt;sudo&lt;/code&gt; fail — including the one you
need to fix it. This shell is already root, so it keeps working no matter what
you do to the config. Close it only once Touch ID prompts.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="copy-the-template"&gt;Copy the template&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="copy-the-template"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#copy-the-template" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;macOS ships the file already written, commented out:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo cp /etc/pam.d/sudo_local.template /etc/pam.d/sudo_local&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-neutral-200 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-neutral-600 hx:hover:text-neutral-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-neutral-800 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-neutral-400 hx:dark:hover:text-neutral-50" title="Copy code" aria-label="Copy code" data-copied-label="Copied!"&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;/etc/pam.d/sudo&lt;/code&gt; has an &lt;code&gt;auth include sudo_local&lt;/code&gt; line at the top, and
&lt;code&gt;sudo_local&lt;/code&gt; is the half that survives OS updates. Adding &lt;code&gt;pam_tid.so&lt;/code&gt; straight
into &lt;code&gt;/etc/pam.d/sudo&lt;/code&gt; works too — until the next update replaces it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="uncomment-the-line"&gt;Uncomment the line&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="uncomment-the-line"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#uncomment-the-line" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo sed -i &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;s/^#auth/auth/&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt; /etc/pam.d/sudo_local&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-neutral-200 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-neutral-600 hx:hover:text-neutral-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-neutral-800 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-neutral-400 hx:dark:hover:text-neutral-50" title="Copy code" aria-label="Copy code" data-copied-label="Copied!"&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Which leaves:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-filename not-prose" dir="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="hx:truncate"&gt;/etc/pam.d/sudo_local&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;auth sufficient pam_tid.so&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-10"&gt;
&lt;button class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-neutral-200 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-neutral-600 hx:hover:text-neutral-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-neutral-800 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-neutral-400 hx:dark:hover:text-neutral-50" title="Copy code" aria-label="Copy code" data-copied-label="Copied!"&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;sufficient&lt;/code&gt; is the important word: Touch ID succeeding is enough, and Touch ID
not being available falls through to the password prompt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="verify-it"&gt;Verify it&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="verify-it"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#verify-it" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo -k
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo -v&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-neutral-200 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-neutral-600 hx:hover:text-neutral-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-neutral-800 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-neutral-400 hx:dark:hover:text-neutral-50" title="Copy code" aria-label="Copy code" data-copied-label="Copied!"&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;sudo -k&lt;/code&gt; drops the cached credential, and &lt;code&gt;sudo -v&lt;/code&gt; asks for authentication and
runs nothing — the harmless way to see the prompt. It should be the Touch ID
sheet, not a password.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div
data-alert="note" class="hextra-alert"
&gt;
&lt;p class="hextra-alert-title"&gt;&lt;svg height=16px class="hextra-alert-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span class="hextra-alert-title-text"&gt;Note&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-alert-content"&gt;&lt;p&gt;PAM reads the file on every &lt;code&gt;sudo&lt;/code&gt;, so the change should apply immediately. If
you still get a password prompt, open a new terminal window, and if that does
not do it either, quit and reopen the terminal app.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="touch-id-for-sudo-inside-tmux"&gt;Touch ID for sudo inside tmux&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="touch-id-for-sudo-inside-tmux"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#touch-id-for-sudo-inside-tmux" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The line above works in Terminal, iTerm2, Ghostty — and not in a tmux pane,
where you get the password prompt instead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;pam_tid.so&lt;/code&gt; has to reach the GUI session to raise the biometric prompt, and it
looks for it in the per-session bootstrap namespace of the process asking. A
tmux server is a daemon: it keeps the namespace of whichever shell first started
it, detached from your Aqua session. Nothing to prompt on, so PAM falls through
to the password.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a
href="https://github.com/fabianishere/pam_reattach"target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;&lt;code&gt;pam_reattach&lt;/code&gt;&lt;svg class="hx:inline hx:rtl:rotate-270 hx:align-baseline" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"&gt;
&lt;path d="m9.1716 7.7574h7.0711m0 0v7.0711m0-7.0711-8.4853 8.4853" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/&gt;
&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt; moves the
authentication into the right namespace before &lt;code&gt;pam_tid.so&lt;/code&gt; runs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-steps hx:ml-4 hx:mb-12 hx:ltr:border-l hx:rtl:border-r hx:border-neutral-200 hx:ltr:pl-6 hx:rtl:pr-6 hx:dark:border-neutral-800 [counter-reset:step]"&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="install-the-module"&gt;Install the module&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="install-the-module"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#install-the-module" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;brew install pam-reattach&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-neutral-200 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-neutral-600 hx:hover:text-neutral-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-neutral-800 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-neutral-400 hx:dark:hover:text-neutral-50" title="Copy code" aria-label="Copy code" data-copied-label="Copied!"&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That builds it and links the module into Homebrew&amp;rsquo;s prefix. Check it landed:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;ls -l &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;$(&lt;/span&gt;brew --prefix&lt;span class="k"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;/lib/pam/pam_reattach.so&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-neutral-200 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-neutral-600 hx:hover:text-neutral-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-neutral-800 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-neutral-400 hx:dark:hover:text-neutral-50" title="Copy code" aria-label="Copy code" data-copied-label="Copied!"&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;details class="hx:last-of-type:mb-0 hx:rounded-lg hx:bg-neutral-100 hx:dark:bg-neutral-900 hx:p-2 hx:mt-4 hx:group hx:border hx:border-neutral-300 hx:dark:border hx:dark:border-neutral-700 hx:transition-colors hx:hover:border-neutral-500 hx:dark:hover:border-neutral-600" open&gt;
&lt;summary class="hx:flex hx:items-center hx:cursor-pointer hx:select-none hx:list-none hx:p-1 hx:rounded-sm hx:transition-colors hx:hover:bg-neutral-200 hx:dark:hover:bg-neutral-800 hx:before:mr-1 hx:before:inline-block hx:before:transition-transform hx:before:content-[''] hx:dark:before:invert hx:rtl:before:rotate-180 hx:group-open:before:rotate-90"&gt;
&lt;strong class="hx:text-lg"&gt;Without Homebrew&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:p-2 hx:overflow-hidden"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CMake, and nothing else:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;git clone https://github.com/fabianishere/pam_reattach
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;cd&lt;/span&gt; pam_reattach
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;Release -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX:PATH&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;/usr/local
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;cmake --build build
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;cmake --install build&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-neutral-200 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-neutral-600 hx:hover:text-neutral-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-neutral-800 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-neutral-400 hx:dark:hover:text-neutral-50" title="Copy code" aria-label="Copy code" data-copied-label="Copied!"&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Three commands, not two — &lt;code&gt;cmake --install&lt;/code&gt; only copies what &lt;code&gt;cmake --build&lt;/code&gt;
produced. The module lands at &lt;code&gt;/usr/local/lib/pam/pam_reattach.so&lt;/code&gt;. Add
&lt;code&gt;-DCMAKE_OSX_ARCHITECTURES=&amp;quot;arm64;x86_64&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt; to the configure step for a
universal build, and to remove it later:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;xargs rm &amp;lt; build/install_manifest.txt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-neutral-200 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-neutral-600 hx:hover:text-neutral-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-neutral-800 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-neutral-400 hx:dark:hover:text-neutral-50" title="Copy code" aria-label="Copy code" data-copied-label="Copied!"&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/details&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="get-the-path-right"&gt;Get the path right&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="get-the-path-right"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#get-the-path-right" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;PAM searches &lt;code&gt;/usr/lib/pam&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;/usr/local/lib/pam&lt;/code&gt;, and nothing else.
Installed from source into &lt;code&gt;/usr/local&lt;/code&gt;, or by Homebrew on an Intel Mac, the
module can be named on its own. Homebrew on Apple Silicon puts it under
&lt;code&gt;/opt/homebrew&lt;/code&gt;, which is neither, so the line needs the full path. Print it
rather than guessing:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;echo&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s2"&gt;&amp;#34;auth optional &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;$(&lt;/span&gt;brew --prefix&lt;span class="k"&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s2"&gt;/lib/pam/pam_reattach.so ignore_ssh&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-neutral-200 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-neutral-600 hx:hover:text-neutral-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-neutral-800 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-neutral-400 hx:dark:hover:text-neutral-50" title="Copy code" aria-label="Copy code" data-copied-label="Copied!"&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="put-it-above-pam_tid"&gt;Put it above pam_tid&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="put-it-above-pam_tid"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#put-it-above-pam_tid" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo nano /etc/pam.d/sudo_local&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-neutral-200 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-neutral-600 hx:hover:text-neutral-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-neutral-800 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-neutral-400 hx:dark:hover:text-neutral-50" title="Copy code" aria-label="Copy code" data-copied-label="Copied!"&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Paste the line from the previous step above the &lt;code&gt;pam_tid.so&lt;/code&gt; line:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-filename not-prose" dir="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="hx:truncate"&gt;/etc/pam.d/sudo_local&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;auth optional /opt/homebrew/lib/pam/pam_reattach.so ignore_ssh
auth sufficient pam_tid.so&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-10"&gt;
&lt;button class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-neutral-200 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-neutral-600 hx:hover:text-neutral-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-neutral-800 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-neutral-400 hx:dark:hover:text-neutral-50" title="Copy code" aria-label="Copy code" data-copied-label="Copied!"&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Order is the whole point — reattaching after the Touch ID attempt has already
failed does nothing. Two words earn their place:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;optional&lt;/code&gt; keeps a missing or broken module from mattering. Uninstall
&lt;code&gt;pam-reattach&lt;/code&gt; later and &lt;code&gt;sudo&lt;/code&gt; asks for your password again instead of
refusing you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;ignore_ssh&lt;/code&gt; skips the reattach when &lt;code&gt;$SSH_CLIENT&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;$SSH_CONNECTION&lt;/code&gt; or
&lt;code&gt;$SSH_TTY&lt;/code&gt; is set. Without it, &lt;code&gt;sudo&lt;/code&gt; in a tmux session you reached over SSH
asks for a touch on a laptop you are not sitting at.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-hextra-search-id="verify-it-1"&gt;Verify it&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="verify-it-1"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#verify-it-1" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Inside a pane, and then outside one, so you know both still work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-shell" data-lang="shell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;tmux new -A -s touchid-test
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo -k
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;sudo -v&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-neutral-200 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-neutral-600 hx:hover:text-neutral-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-neutral-800 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-neutral-400 hx:dark:hover:text-neutral-50" title="Copy code" aria-label="Copy code" data-copied-label="Copied!"&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div
data-alert="note" class="hextra-alert"
&gt;
&lt;p class="hextra-alert-title"&gt;&lt;svg height=16px class="hextra-alert-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span class="hextra-alert-title-text"&gt;Note&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-alert-content"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Again, the next &lt;code&gt;sudo&lt;/code&gt; should pick the change up on its own. If a pane still
asks for a password, restart the tmux server — &lt;code&gt;tmux kill-server&lt;/code&gt;, which ends
every session on it — and reattach. If it survives even that, quit and reopen
the terminal app.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div
data-alert="note" class="hextra-alert"
&gt;
&lt;p class="hextra-alert-title"&gt;&lt;svg height=16px class="hextra-alert-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path d="M0 8a8 8 0 1 1 16 0A8 8 0 0 1 0 8Zm8-6.5a6.5 6.5 0 1 0 0 13 6.5 6.5 0 0 0 0-13ZM6.5 7.75A.75.75 0 0 1 7.25 7h1a.75.75 0 0 1 .75.75v2.75h.25a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5h.25v-2h-.25a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75ZM8 6a1 1 0 1 1 0-2 1 1 0 0 1 0 2Z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;span class="hextra-alert-title-text"&gt;Note&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-alert-content"&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anything else that starts a shell outside your GUI session can show the same
symptom. The integrated terminals in VS Code and JetBrains IDEs usually need
nothing, being children of the app itself — but if one of them asks for a
password while Terminal does not, it is this same cause and this same fix.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="when-it-does-not-work"&gt;When it does not work&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="when-it-does-not-work"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#when-it-does-not-work" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Symptom&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Cause&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Password prompt in tmux, Touch ID everywhere else&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;pam_reattach&lt;/code&gt; missing, or listed below &lt;code&gt;pam_tid.so&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Password prompt over SSH&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;No sensor at the far end. Expected — &lt;code&gt;sufficient&lt;/code&gt; falls through&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Works, then stops after an OS update&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;The line went into &lt;code&gt;/etc/pam.d/sudo&lt;/code&gt;, not &lt;code&gt;sudo_local&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Nothing prompts and the password is refused&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Typo in &lt;code&gt;sudo_local&lt;/code&gt;. Fix it from the root shell you kept open&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="the-finished-file"&gt;The finished file&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="the-finished-file"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#the-finished-file" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Both halves together, and nothing else in it:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-filename not-prose" dir="auto"&gt;&lt;span class="hx:truncate"&gt;/etc/pam.d/sudo_local&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;# sudo_local: local config file which survives system update and is included for sudo
auth optional /opt/homebrew/lib/pam/pam_reattach.so ignore_ssh
auth sufficient pam_tid.so&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-10"&gt;
&lt;button class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-neutral-200 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-neutral-600 hx:hover:text-neutral-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-neutral-800 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-neutral-400 hx:dark:hover:text-neutral-50" title="Copy code" aria-label="Copy code" data-copied-label="Copied!"&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drop the first &lt;code&gt;auth&lt;/code&gt; line if you never use tmux. &lt;code&gt;/etc/pam.d/sudo&lt;/code&gt; stays
untouched — it already includes this file.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>